      "title": "Untitled",
      "visualSettings": "{\"general\":{\"mode\":\"TextPanel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"displayType\":\"default\"},\"title\":{\"fontSize\":14},\"series\":{},\"text\":{\"showTitle\":false,\"format\":\"markdown\"},\"legend\":{\"enabled\":false}}",
      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "### 1. *ServerSetupTime* : Time in microseconds taken for setting up connection at server.\n### 2. *ConnectionSetupTime* : \tTime taken by the App Connector to process a notification from the App Connector selection microservice and set up the connection to the application server.\n### 3. *ConnectorZENSetupTime* : Time in microseconds taken for setting up connection between App Connector and ZPA Public Service Edge  or ZPA Private Service Edge.\n### 4. *AppLearnTime* : \tTime in microseconds taken for App Connectors to learn about the requested application and report the learned information to the central authority\n"
